# Accepted findings - each one is a requirement of the assignment or an AWS limitation.

# ALB is internet-facing: the frontend must be exposed to the internet.
AVD-AWS-0053

# HTTP listener: the assignment requires exposure "with ALB over HTTP only".
AVD-AWS-0054

# ALB access-log bucket uses SSE-S3: ALB log delivery supports only SSE-S3, not SSE-KMS.
AVD-AWS-0132
